{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>YHWH reigns, the peoples tremble</b> — the word מלך, a different word serves after it: מלך יושב הכרובים (the King who sits upon the cherubim)." "<b>let the earth quake</b> — like תרעש (it shakes), and there is no companion to it." "And the meaning of ירגזו עמים — they are the wicked."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 99, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:34.201939232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}